<article class="env-remark" id="0D8C">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0D8C">Remark <span data-tag="0D8C">85.16.4</span> <span class="named">(Variant for over an object)</span>.</a>  Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a site. Let $X \in \mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C})$. Recall that we have a category $\text{SR}(\mathcal{C}, X) = \text{SR}(\mathcal{C}/X)$ of semi-representable objects over $X$, see Remark <a href="/tag/0D89" data-tag="0D89">85.15.5</a>. We may apply the above discussion to the site $\mathcal{C}/X$. Briefly, the constructions above give </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
a site $(\mathcal{C}/K)_{total}$ for a simplicial $K$ object of $\text{SR}(\mathcal{C}, X)$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
a localization functor $j_{total} : (\mathcal{C}/K)_{total} \to \mathcal{C}/X$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
localization functors $j_ n : \mathcal{C}/K_ n \to \mathcal{C}/X$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
a morphism of topoi $a : \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits ((\mathcal{C}/K)_{total}) \to \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C}/X)$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
morphisms of topoi $a_ n : \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C}/K_ n) \to \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C}/X)$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
a functor $a^{Sh}_! : \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits ((\mathcal{C}/K)_{total}) \to \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (\mathcal{C}/X)$ left adjoint to $a^{-1}$, and 
</p>
</li><li><p>
a functor $a_! : \textit{Ab}((\mathcal{C}/K)_{total}) \to \textit{Ab}(\mathcal{C}/X)$ left adjoint to $a^{-1}$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
  <p> All of the results of this section hold in this setting. To prove this one replaces the site $\mathcal{C}$ everywhere by $\mathcal{C}/X$. </p>
</article>